    "title": "VolleyOS Global API",
    "description": "36 volleyball engines: biomechanics, rotations, scouting, scoreboards, tournaments, pickup, OBS overlay, pocket VAR, beach, volleycards, tempo, ACWR, block shadow, seams, setter IQ, lineup slips, integrity seals, offline capsules, referee cards, substitutions, court split, fan signals, setter playbooks, MVP awards, timeout chalkboards, momentum coaching, snake captain drafts, roster passes, equipment inspection, SVG posters, serve radar, matchup matrices, block-out labs, practice planning, play-by-play narration and player career passports. Decimal-only maths, no telemetry.",
